From d18a230e542852232dd7561aa4718f3c6aef353e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:17:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] usb: dwc3-msm: signal probe completion to Samsung
 usb_notify

The LineageOS dwc3-msm never sets dwc3_msm_probe_done or calls
enable_usb_notify(), so usb_notify keeps the boot-time VBUS event
reserved forever ("reserve_state_check wait dwc3 probe done").
Charging works but the gadget never enumerates: no adb, no MTP.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KfdEw7FqSm92uoQmEa9GaX
---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-msm.c | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-msm.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-msm.c
index 6f135a74a..1f7e9058e 100755
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-msm.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-msm.c
@@ -4390,6 +4390,17 @@ static int dwc3_msm_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	device_create_file(&pdev->dev, &dev_attr_usb_compliance_mode);
 	device_create_file(&pdev->dev, &dev_attr_bus_vote);
 
+	/*
+	 * Overgrowth: tell Samsung's usb_notify layer that dwc3 is ready.
+	 * Without this, the VBUS event reserved during boot is never replayed
+	 * (reserve_state_check: "wait dwc3 probe done") and the gadget never
+	 * enumerates on the PC: USB charges, but no adb/MTP.
+	 */
+	mdwc->dwc3_msm_probe_done = 1;
+#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_USB_NOTIFY_LAYER)
+	enable_usb_notify();
+#endif
+
 	return 0;
 
 put_dwc3:
